<span id="S4.T1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="S4.T1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.T1.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Prompt Template:</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T1.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r">
<span id="S4.T1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="S4.T1.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.T1.2.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">For the audio category "{AudioSet Class}", list 5 related sound event keywords that can co-occur in real-world soundscapes. Ensure these keywords are distinct from the original category and describe relevant sounds or acoustic contexts.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T1.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="S4.T1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="S4.T1.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.T1.2.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Example (Input Class = ”Rain”)</span>:</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T1.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_b ltx_border_l ltx_border_r">
<span id="S4.T1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="S4.T1.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.T1.2.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">1. Thunder, 2. Raindrops on window, 3. Wind gusts, 4. Distant traffic, 5. Water splashing</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
<figure id="S4.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>Comparison of keyword set sizes. The expanded AudioSet+GPT3.5 set introduces significantly more keyword diversity to improve prompt coverage and representation.</figcaption>
<table id="S4.T2.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S4.T2.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S4.T2.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="S4.T2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Keyword Set</span></th>
<th id="S4.T2.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t"><span id="S4.T2.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Number of Unique Classes</span></th></tr>
